---
import "../styles/components/projects.css";
---

<section id="work" class="work wrap">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">FROM THE WORKBENCH</p>
      <h2>
        A few things<br />I've been making<span class="gold">.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Some solve an everyday problem.<br />Some start with “what if?”<br />All
      have a little Melo in them.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    <article id="melotv" class="project-card tv-card wide">
      <div class="card-copy">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span>STREAMING SUITE</span>
          <span class="status">Open source</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Melo TV</h3>
        <p>
          Movies and TV on your own server.<br />A clean, self-hosted streaming
          suite for Mac, iPhone, web, and Docker.
        </p>
        <button class="card-btn" data-project="melotv">Take a closer look</button>
        <span class="platform">macOS · iOS · Web · Docker</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tv-art project-art">
        <img
          src="/assets/melotv.svg"
          alt="Melo TV streaming display mark"
        />
        <div class="art-caption">
          <span>STREAM FREELY.</span>
          <span>Your movies. Your server.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article id="zipmelo" class="project-card zip-card wide">
      <div class="card-copy">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span>UNDER THE HOOD</span>
          <span class="status">Open source · Swift 6</span>
        </div>
        <h3>ZipMelo</h3>
        <p>
          Fast, memory-safe ZIP & CBZ engine.<br />Built around how comic and
          manga readers actually access pages.
        </p>
        <button class="card-btn" data-project="zipmelo">Take a closer look</button>
        <span class="platform">Swift 6 · macOS CLI</span>
      </div>
      <div class="small-art zip-art project-art">
        <img
          src="/assets/zipmelo.png"
          alt="ZipMelo’s golden retriever character"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <span class="zip-type" aria-hidden="true"
          >zip.<br />read.<br />repeat.</span
        >
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="work-footnote">
    Always tinkering. More things are on the way. <a
      href="https://github.com/tinymelo"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">Follow along</a>
  </p>
</section>
